### Base URL
@GPMuseumify_HostAddress = http://localhost:5004

################################################################
### 1️⃣ Register
POST {{GPMuseumify_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "name": "alaa",
  "email": "alaasamer2004@gmail.com",
  "password": "alaa12345",
  "phoneNumber": "01033264791"

}



### Login 
POST {{GPMuseumify_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alaasamer222004@gmail.com",
  "password": "alaaaa"
}

### 3️⃣ Verify Email 
POST {{GPMuseumify_HostAddress}}/api/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alaasamer222004@gmail.com",
  "code": "9476"
}

### 4️⃣ Resend Verification Code 
POST {{GPMuseumify_HostAddress}}/api/auth/resend-verification
Content-Type: application/json

{
 
    "email": "alaasamer222004@gmail.com"
  
}

### 1️⃣ Forgot Password — يبعث OTP على الإيميل
POST {{GPMuseumify_HostAddress}}/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alaasamer222004@gmail.com"
}


### 2️⃣ Verify Reset Code — تأكيد صحة الـ OTP قبل شاشة تغيير الباسورد
POST {{GPMuseumify_HostAddress}}/api/auth/verify-reset-code
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alaasamer222004@gmail.com",
  "code": "9464"
}

### 3️⃣ Reset Password — تغيير الباسورد (بعد ما الـ OTP يتأكد)
POST {{GPMuseumify_HostAddress}}/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "7ac6ea8c70e54543926967a220f133f1",
  "newPassword": "1234567",
  "confirmPassword": "1234567"
}

### 7️⃣ Social Login 
POST {{GPMuseumify_HostAddress}}/api/auth/social-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "google",
  "token": "social_token_here"
}
### 8️⃣ Search Artifacts

POST {{GPMuseumify_HostAddress}}/api/search
Content-Type: application/json
{
"query": "ram",
  "type": "statue",
  "page": 1,
  "pageSize": 10
}
### 9️⃣ Logout
POST {{GPMuseumify_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}


# من الـ response انسخ "token" وحطّه في @Token تحت عشان Get/Update Profile

### ---------- Personal Information (بعد اللوجن) ----------
@Token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..e4bEA0QaTXREztcGWkyfobJEo-fV8aFVTeHFrbFKXM0
### Get My Profile — جلب الاسم، الإيميل، رقم التلفون (اللي اتخزنوا وقت الـ Register)
GET {{GPMuseumify_HostAddress}}/api/users/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Update My Profile — تعديل الاسم و/أو رقم التلفون (زر Edit)
PUT {{GPMuseumify_HostAddress}}/api/users/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Menna Hisham",
  "phoneNumber": "+20 01012345678"
}


## delete account
POST {{GPMuseumify_HostAddress}}/api/users/me/delete-account
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "123456"
}


## @name login
POST {{GPMuseumify_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alaasamer222004@gmail.com",
  "password": "123456"
}


################################################################
### ---------- Tests: Search / Favorites / History (بعد تطبيق الـ migration) ----------
### استبدلي @UserId بالـ user id من الـ login response (أو من الـ JWT claim "sub")
@UserId = f3505092-1aa0-4ffc-b3c7-992c6346a87a

### 1) Search تماثيل (يُرجع الـ seeded: أخناتون، نفرتيتي، رمسيس)
POST {{GPMuseumify_HostAddress}}/api/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "ram",
  "type": "statue",
  "page": 1,
  "pageSize": 10
}

### 2) Search متاحف (يُرجع أهرامات الجيزة)
POST {{GPMuseumify_HostAddress}}/api/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "pyramid",
  "type": "museum",
  "page": 1,
  "pageSize": 10
}

### 3) إضافة تمثال للمفضلة (استخدمي statueId من نتيجة البحث أو من الـ seed)
POST {{GPMuseumify_HostAddress}}/api/users/6afe1bc6-85da-417f-85b3-7f738dee9751/favorites
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..cSPvoQsPi3QvqHqJ6ly8_yIxcYD0bJ1t-qg55Y2Mpgc
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "statueId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "museumId": null
}

### 4) إضافة متحف للمفضلة
POST {{GPMuseumify_HostAddress}}/api/users/{{UserId}}/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "statueId": null,
  "museumId": "44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444"
}

### 5) جلب قائمة المفضلة (هتظهر الصور في ThumbnailUrl / ImageUrl)
GET {{GPMuseumify_HostAddress}}/api/users/{{UserId}}/favorites?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### 6) إضافة للهيستوري (تمثال)
POST {{GPMuseumify_HostAddress}}/api/History?userId={{UserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "statueId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "museumId": null,
  "searchType": "statue"
}

### 7) جلب الهيستوري (هتظهر الصور في ThumbnailUrl)
GET {{GPMuseumify_HostAddress}}/api/History?userId={{UserId}}&page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### 8) روابط الصور مباشرة (للتحقق أن الصور تخدم)
# GET {{GPMuseumify_HostAddress}}/images/statues/nefertiti.jpg
# GET {{GPMuseumify_HostAddress}}/images/museums/pyramids.jpg

### ---------- IDs الجديدة (بعد تطبيق migration SeedMoreStatuesAndMuseums) ----------
# تماثيل: 55555555-5555-5555-5555-555555550001 (توت عنخ آمون), 550002 (Pharaoh Bust), 550003 (Pharaoh Bust II),
# 550004 (Pharaoh Head), 550005 (Pharaoh Standing), 550006 (Ramses Standing), 550007 (Pharaoh in Museum),
# 550008 (أبو سمبل), 550009 (Nefertiti Stylized), 55000a (Nefertiti Collage), 55000b (Nefertiti Detail)
# متاحف: 66666666-6666-6666-6666-666666660001 (Grand Egyptian Museum), 660002 (Egyptian Temple),
# 660003 (Mummies), 660004 (Mummy Close-up), 660005 (Statue Collection)